#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0305 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "PLAN-scalar-date-extremes: EX ABSENT (not in 0305's Requirements) while POOLDEF is present: no subject is dosed per the data ($ex_usubjid is empty, $pool_ex_rows counts nothing), RFXSTDTC populated -> silent. Pin. ⚑ PLAN-join-key-one-side-absent-drop QK17 (owner 2026-10-11): split by the pool gate — EX absent while POOLDEF defines pools: CDISC-SEND-0305 needs EX.POOLID and SKIPS, CDISC-SEND-0305-A needs no POOLDEF.POOLID and SKIPS too (was noViolation)"
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset DM label=Demographics
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col RFXSTDTC type=Char label="Date/Time of First Study Treatment"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | 2020-01-01
---
dataset POOLDEF label="Pool Definition"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col POOLID  type=Char label="Pool Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
S1 | P1 | 001
---
